 HISTORY                                                          8205 1451
 -------                                                          8205 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8205 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University, USA. The inelastic          8205 1451
 scattering thermal scattering law data for UO2 were developed    8205 1451
 using ab intio lattice dynamics methods [1,2]. The Full Law      8205 1451
 Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) code was used to         8205 1451
 produce File 7 MT=2 and 4 for U in UO2 and O in UO2 [3]. MAT=85  8205 1451
 and ZA=185 were used for U in UO2 (5% enriched).                 8205 1451
